    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">FASTag and documentation management:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Attach the vehicle’s FASTag securely to the bike’s front fork or handlebar, ensuring it is readable at toll plazas. Keep the original RC, insurance copy, and booking confirmation (e.g., IRCTC bike parcel booking online receipt) together in a waterproof envelope.</p>
